                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.00/1475: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Austria</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wiley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-15T13:00:00+01:00">March 15, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 15—11:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>86. New press chief has just confirmed to the Legation that Austrian Foreign
                    Minister turned over affairs of Ministry this morning to Ribbentrop who arrived
                    last night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wiley</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
